# ─── Node / JS / TS — repo-wide ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every subproject (framework, capstones, future modules) gets these for free.
# Note: leading `**/` makes the pattern match at any depth.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/
**/test-results/
**/allure-results/
**/allure-report/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.vite/
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Local analytics/trend-store databases (framework flake CLI writes ./analytics.db)
**/analytics.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Env files — never commit secrets. .env.example IS tracked (no .example exclusion).
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ─── Original Java template (kept for back-compat) ──────────────────────────
# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/java
# Edit at https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore?templates=java

### Java ###
# Compiled class file
*.class

# Log file
*.log


# Obsidian
.Obsidian

# BlueJ files
*.ctxt

# Mobile Tools for Java (J2ME)
.mtj.tmp/

# Package Files #
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/java
**/__pycache__/
